<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - March 7.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - March 7.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports in the Murmansk region in the north of European Russia may be closed on March 7 due to strong winds and heavy snowstorms, the Russian Weather Service said on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
